# Context for web/Dockerfile, which is built from the repository root
# (`docker build -f web/Dockerfile .`) because the image's entrypoint is a Go
# program. Everything is excluded except what the two build stages read:
# the web sources, and the Go module with the packages install-bundle needs.

*

!LICENSE
!go.mod
!go.sum
!scripts/third-party-notices.sh
!cmd/install-bundle
!internal/bundleinstall
!internal/buildinfo
!internal/cli
**/*_test.go

!web
# The image builds the bundle from source; nothing local belongs in it.
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/.__mf__temp
web/testdata
web/Dockerfile
web/Dockerfile.dockerignore
web/e2e
web/e2e-results
web/playwright-report
web/playwright.config.ts
